notes: Run against our apitrace stream via orchestrator/cape_compat.py +
       orchestrator/cape_engine.py (NOT a full CAPE deployment). Coverage is
       inherently partial: our hookset is Nt-level, so Win32-only filters and
       unhooked API families (network/services/com) cannot match.
